  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INCLUSIVE LESOTHO ELECTION CYCLE SUPPORT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action will enhance the capacity of both IEC and the Ministry of Local Government, Chieftainship, Home Affairs and Police. It provides electoral cycle support to IEC in planning and implementing election operations, voter registration, candidate nomination, awareness, polling, counting, and election dispute resolution. It will also provide legal support to IEC in improving the regulatory framework and establishing rules and procedures. IEC will be supported with trainings on civic education,</narrative>
  </description>
